OL,3,ABody-worn cameras given to school
OL,4,Acrossing wardens
OL,5,
OL,6,FLollipop men and women in Sheffield
OL,7,Fhave been given body-worn cameras in an
OL,8,Feffort to combat abuse and aggressive
OL,9,Fbehaviour from drivers.
OL,11,FSheffield City Council said school
OL,12,Fcrossing wardens at several unspecified
OL,13,Flocations across the city would be
OL,14,Fgiven the cameras, which will record
OL,15,Finteractions, as part of a new
OL,16,Finitiative.
OL,18,FThe local authority said the measure
OL,19,Fwould create a safer environment for
OL,20,Ffamilies walking to school in the new
OL,21,Facademic year and provide reassurance
OL,22,Fto staff working alone.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
